{
  "title": "Unique Creamy Indian Foie Gras Biryani",
  "description": "A cultured and fluffy monsoon Indian dish featuring foie-gras and lardons-render, made dairy-free friendly. This creamy biryani combines the richness of foie gras with the warmth of Indian spices.",
